  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Government of Chile in strengthening its national capacity and to effectively and efficiently update and implement the National Adaptation Plan to Climate Change (NAP-2014), as the guiding instrument to facilitate the integration of climate change adaptation, in a coherent manner, into relevant new and existing policies, programs and activities, in particular development planning processes and strategies, within all relevant sectors and at different levels.</narrative>
